@startuml react-loop
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #3b82f6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #3b82f6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #eff6ff
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #1e293b
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #cbd5e1
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam noteBorderColor #f59e0b
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #fffbeb
skinparam noteFontColor #92400e

title ReAct Loop：推理-行动循环

participant "LLM" as llm
participant "Harness Runtime" as runtime
participant "Tools" as tools

loop 直到任务完成或达到步骤上限
    llm -> llm : Thought：分析当前状态\n规划下一步行动
    llm -> runtime : Action：tool_call(name, args)
    runtime -> tools : 执行工具调用
    tools -> runtime : 返回结果
    runtime -> llm : Observation：工具结果注入上下文
end

llm -> runtime : Final Answer

note over runtime
  Harness 负责：
  • 格式化工具调用
  • 捕获异常和超时
  • 注入 Observation
  • 检测循环/卡死
  • 执行步骤上限
end note

@enduml
